-----------------------------------------

19. Aggregate Functions
-----------------------
COUNT()
SUM()
AVG()
MIN()
MAX()

-----------------------------------------

20. String Functions
--------------------
UPPER()
LOWER()
LENGTH()
CONCAT()
SUBSTRING()
TRIM()
REPLACE()

-----------------------------------------

21. Date Functions
------------------
NOW()
CURDATE()
CURTIME()
